"How to assess a remote internship"}],[["$","p","Look for a named organisation, a specific manager or team, defined learning outcomes and a clear recruitment process. Avoid opportunities that ask candidates to pay for equipment, training or guaranteed placement.",{"children":"Look for a named organisation, a specific manager or team, defined learning outcomes and a clear recruitment process. Avoid opportunities that ask candidates to pay for equipment, training or guaranteed placement."}]],"$L16"]}],"$L17","$L18","$L19"]]}],"$L1a","$L1b"]}],"$L1c"]}]
